add('requirements.html', {
  path:'/requirements', title:'Dog Daycare & Boarding Requirements', description:'Review Jollytails Resort age, vaccine, assessment, attendance, health, and collar requirements for daycare and boarding guests.',
  body: hero({kicker:'Guest Requirements',title:'A safe start for every social dog.',copy:'Daycare and boarding guests follow the same core eligibility requirements. These steps help the Resort team build comfortable playgroups and prepare for each visit.',image:img.daycare,alt:'A group of dogs playing together in the Resort outdoor turf area',actions:[requestButton('/daycare/assessment','Request An Assessment'),button('/daycare','Explore Daycare','button-outline')]}) +
  `<section class="section"><div class="container">${sectionHead('Core Requirements','Before daycare or boarding.')}<div class="requirements-grid"><article>${sectionHead('Age And Social Fit','Eligibility.')} ${list(['At least 16 weeks old.','Spayed or neutered at six months of age or older.','Comfortable participating in supervised group daycare.','Successful Jollytails Resort daycare assessment.'])}</article><article>${sectionHead('Vaccinations And Health','Current records required.')} ${list(['Rabies.','DA2PP/DHPP, covering distemper, adenovirus/hepatitis, parainfluenza, and parvovirus.','Leptospirosis.','Annual Bordetella.','Free of fleas, ticks, and signs of contagious illness.'])}</article><article>${sectionHead('At Daycare','Safe play gear.')} ${list(['Quick-release collar.','No hanging tags, trackers, or AirTags while in daycare.','No harnesses, choke collars, prong collars, or electronic collars in the play areas.'])}</article></div></div></section>` +
  `<section class="section section-sky"><div class="container content-two-col"><div>${sectionHead('Assessment And Attendance','Getting to know your dog.') }<p>New dogs begin with an interview and careful introduction to staff dogs and an appropriate playgroup. A successful assessment continues with a half-day visit at the regular partial-day rate.</p><p>To keep the Resort familiar, daycare and boarding guests should attend at least once every three months. A dog away longer may need another assessment.</p></div><aside class="callout-card"><p class="card-tag">Other Locations</p><h2>A Resort assessment is still required.</h2><p>Client profiles, assessments, and packages are not shared between Jollytails locations. A dog attending another location needs a separate Resort profile and assessment.</p></aside></div></section>` + cta('Does your dog meet the requirements?','Begin with the assessment request. The form itself will be connected before launch.',[requestButton('/daycare/assessment','Start The Assessment Path')])
});

add('k9-sport-sack.html', {
  path:'/k9-sport-sack', title:'K9 Sport Sack Carriers At Jollytails Resort', description:'Explore K9 Sport Sack forward-facing dog carriers, fitting guidance, videos, accessories, and special ordering at Jollytails Resort in Halifax.',
  body: hero({kicker:'Authorized K9 Sport Sack Retailer',title:'More adventures. No dog left behind.',copy:'K9 Sport Sack forward-facing backpack carriers help your dog come along for more of the journey—and take a comfortable break when walking is no longer the best option.',image:img.k9Hero,alt:'A dog riding in a K9 Sport Sack backpack carrier during an outdoor adventure',position:'76% 50%',actionsClass:'equal-action-buttons',actions:[button('/contact','Visit For In-Store Fitting'),button('https://k9sportsack.com/pages/sizing','Official Sizing Guide','button-outline','target="_blank" rel="noopener"')]}) +
  `<section class="section"><div class="container">${cards([
    {mark:'Local',title:'Nova Scotia Retailer',copy:'Jollytails Resort is proud to be the only retailer in Nova Scotia carrying an assortment of K9 Sport Sack models and accessories.'},
    {mark:'Fit',title:'Try The Right Size',copy:'Bring your dog to the Resort and the team can help compare carrier sizes and find a comfortable, secure fit.'},
    {mark:'Order',title:'More Options Available',copy:'If the model, colour, size, or accessory you want is not in store, ask about ordering it from K9 Sport Sack’s Canadian warehouse and having it shipped to your door.'}
  ])}</div></section>` +
  `<section class="section section-sky"><div class="container">${split({image:img.k9Authorized,alt:'K9 Sport Sack authorized retailer graphic showing a dog in a backpack carrier',kicker:'What Is K9 Sport Sack?',title:'A safe, forward-facing way to adventure together.',imageClass:'k9-authorized-image',body:`<p>K9 Sport Sack carriers let dogs ride upright on their person’s back. They are designed to bring you closer to your best friend and open up trips or places that might otherwise be out of reach.</p><p>The carrier is not a replacement for exercise. It gives your dog a break during a hike, bike ride, commute, shopping trip, or another shared outing.</p>${list(['Bring a smaller dog along on everyday travels, including the bus, bike rides, and shopping.','Help a senior dog or a dog with mobility concerns spend more time by your side.','Give a tired dog a break on a longer hike or adventure.','Let a little dog travel comfortably—and in style.'])}`})}</div></section>` +
  `<section class="section"><div class="container">${sectionHead('Watch And Learn','See the carrier, fitting process, and sizing guidance.','These are the three K9 Sport Sack videos featured on the original Jollytails Resort page.',true)}<div class="k9-video-grid"><article class="k9-video-card"><div class="k9-video-frame"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/j6to-Abge7k" title="K9 Sport Sack feature with Trending Today" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe></div><div><p class="card-tag">Product Feature</p><h3>Meet K9 Sport Sack</h3><p>See the forward-facing carrier and how people use it to share more experiences with their dogs.</p></div></article><article class="k9-video-card"><div class="k9-video-frame"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Li4NX2WMYk4" title="How to get your dog into a K9 Sport Sack backpack carrier" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe></div><div><p class="card-tag">How To Use It</p><h3>Getting Your Dog Into The Carrier</h3><p>Watch the step-by-step process, then practise calmly so the carrier becomes a familiar part of your routine.</p></div></article><article class="k9-video-card"><div class="k9-video-frame"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/shpyx4bELOk" title="K9 Sport Sack video sizing guide" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe></div><div><p class="card-tag">Video Sizing Guide</p><h3>Choosing A Size</h3><p>Learn how K9 Sport Sack measures dogs for its backpack carriers and why the correct fit matters.</p></div></article></div></div></section>` +
  `<section class="section section-cream"><div class="container k9-sizing-layout"><figure class="k9-sizing-figure"><img src="${img.k9SizeGuide}" alt="Illustrated K9 Sport Sack back-length size guide from extra small through extra extra large" width="720" height="1188" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>Sizing chart carried over from the original Resort page.</figcaption></figure><div>${sectionHead('How To Select A Size','Start with your dog’s back length.')}<p>Bring your dog to Jollytails Resort for help selecting a carrier, or begin with K9 Sport Sack’s online guide. Measure from the base of the neck, where the collar sits, to the base of the tail. Weight can help narrow the model, but the back-length measurement is essential for choosing the size.</p><p>A secure fit supports comfort and safety for both dog and wearer. Product ranges and sizing can change, so use the current manufacturer guide or confirm the fit with the Resort team before purchasing.</p><div class="button-row">${button('https://k9sportsack.com/pages/sizing','Open Current Sizing Guide','button-primary','target="_blank" rel="noopener"')}${button('/contact','Visit With Your Dog','button-outline')}</div></div></div></section>` +
  `<section class="section section-sky"><div class="container content-two-col"><div>${sectionHead('Models, Colours And Accessories','Find the combination that works for you.')}<p>The Resort carries an assortment of K9 Sport Sack carrier models and accessories. Selection changes, so call ahead if you are looking for something specific.</p><p>If the exact model, size, colour, or accessory is not on the shelf, let the team know. Jollytails Resort can arrange an order from the Canadian warehouse and have it shipped directly to your door.</p></div><aside class="callout-card"><p class="card-tag">Explore The Full Range</p><h2>Compare current models and features.</h2><p>The official K9 Sport Sack website has current carrier details, accessories, sizing tools, and additional how-to guidance.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://k9sportsack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit K9 Sport Sack ↗</a></aside></div></section>` +
  cta('Want to check current stock?','Carrier models, colours, sizes, and accessories can change. Call or visit the Resort before making a special trip.',[button('tel:+19024448245','Call The Pet Store','button-light'),button('/contact','Hours And Directions','button-blue')])
});

